Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.89,0:00:04.79,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.23,0:00:07.35,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.65,0:00:11.95,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,We were at the Emperor's Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.95,0:00:14.04,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Saneatsu, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.04,0:00:15.41,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Saaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.79,0:00:18.96,monitor-block,Sign,0,0,0,,Welcome back Saneatsu and Saaya!\N We don't have much time.\N My Presentation Right will give you\Ndirections to follow, for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.67,0:00:23.17,monitor-block,Sign,0,0,0,,There should be monitors around you.\N I'll show you what's been happening and where to head.\N You can catch up with us as you read them!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.56,0:00:41.48,Show Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\pos(320,110)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:01:58.51,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was an insane plan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.51,0:02:01.77,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}It didn't matter how many \Nof us died, foe or ally.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.77,0:02:04.01,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}The only thing that mattered was stalling,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.01,0:02:10.18,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}so that the Emperor, Queen, \Nand Teppei stayed put.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.04,0:02:13.96,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yagihashi, you were always \Nplanning for the bigger picture,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.96,0:02:16.03,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}unlike the rest of us.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.89,0:02:18.78,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}As for me, I'll put an end to this.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.27,0:02:21.03,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}For good!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.10,0:02:33.42,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Raion, what happened to Kou and Iruga?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.83,0:02:35.51,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Don't panic when you hear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.30,0:02:37.64,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,They were both killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.07,0:02:41.31,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,But we were able to annihilate the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.31,0:02:45.08,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,The best we could do was seclude \NYagihashi in a divided space.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.07,0:02:49.02,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,So we won by a narrow margin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.28,0:02:51.73,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're okay though, Raion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.19,0:02:56.80,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'm only the messenger, so I don't \Nunderstand what this means but,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.58,0:02:59.95,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,"I leave the Mother Light to Lady Kisaragi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.95,0:03:02.14,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,It should be under your full command."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.14,0:03:03.66,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,That was the message he left for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.56,0:03:05.66,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.30,0:03:11.18,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,There's no one waiting \Nat the church to bless us. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.67,0:03:15.84,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Let's resurrect Teppei right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.25,0:03:19.80,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,It's our only option given the circumstance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:23.31,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Once we revive Teppei and the \NObedience Right is in our hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.31,0:03:25.56,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,the world will be under our command.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.56,0:03:28.44,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Before that, I want to talk with Haruto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:32.70,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You have a lot of catching up to do \Nas siblings once Teppei's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.70,0:03:34.69,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I figured we should talk before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.06,0:03:36.34,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.34,0:03:37.53,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:42.25,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I have something important to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.36,0:03:47.81,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,They need us for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:52.71,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs23\an7\pos(189,154)\c&H5B5B54&}Raion has the ultimate defense against the Emperor, so he'll be fine no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:52.71,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs23\an7\c&H5B5B54&\pos(189,302)}So I need you to focus on just one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.84,0:03:53.71,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs30\an7\c&H5B5B54&\pos(145,79)}Use "Ryuta's last gift"!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.26,0:04:15.19,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ryuta's last gift...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:20.57,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Haruto, I want you to retract \Nyour negotiation with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.57,0:04:21.32,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.53,0:04:25.70,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Wh-What do you mean retract it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:27.21,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Don't take it the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.01,0:04:33.20,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,As long as the Negotiation Right \Nrequires me to stay loyal to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.20,0:04:37.95,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I can't prove that my friendship \Nisn't out of obligation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.31,0:04:44.82,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Okay. I believe in you, Raion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.35,0:04:49.17,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Everything we've been through \Nhas gotta be real...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.08,0:04:53.36,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,so I retract my negotiation agreement!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.86,0:04:55.50,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,One more thing, Haruto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.50,0:04:56.44,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.44,0:04:58.95,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You said you want it to be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.95,0:05:00.74,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,So let's make a new agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.74,0:05:07.65,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'll tell you how I truly feel about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.39,0:05:11.21,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,In return, you'll have to hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.75,0:05:17.64,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,It scares me, but I want to \Nknow how you really feel,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.02,0:05:19.89,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,so I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.89,0:05:22.89,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,You good with me finalizing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.26,0:05:24.14,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:28.85,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Negotiation complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.85,0:05:32.75,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}This isn't related to our plans. \NIt's not even necessary.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.75,0:05:34.24,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}But that's okay with me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.24,0:05:37.56,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{'\i1}This is my truth that replaces \Nthe "love" command.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.55,0:05:42.57,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I lost my closest relative in Tasuketsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.91,0:05:45.82,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'll be honest: I hated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.41,0:05:49.38,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,But as we spent time together, I realized...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.38,0:05:52.75,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,you were just a normal kid too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.95,0:05:58.50,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I started seeing you as Haruto, \Nnot the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.85,0:06:00.46,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Someone who wanted to be friends with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.46,0:06:02.51,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,and who laughed like a normal kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.04,0:06:06.26,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You may have done something \Nterrible as the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:10.59,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,But I've decided that no matter \Nwhat anyone tells me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.59,0:06:12.63,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,no matter how contradictory it may seem,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.63,0:06:16.19,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I won't lie to myself anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.70,0:06:21.75,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Even if you have an evil side \Nthat betrayed people,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.75,0:06:24.04,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I know there's someone genuine behind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.04,0:06:26.66,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'll believe in the real you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.66,0:06:28.05,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.05,0:06:30.71,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,No matter what happens from now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.71,0:06:33.55,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I swear I'll come save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.93,0:06:34.92,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Raion!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.13,0:06:40.00,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I swear I'll believe in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.87,0:06:42.86,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I won't do bad stuff anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.43,0:06:45.38,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I was wrong to do all of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.88,0:06:48.68,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Raion, it's just as I thought.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.71,0:06:52.75,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,You don't want to be crying \Nwhen we revive Teppei, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.75,0:06:54.81,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I'm not crying! I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.95,0:06:57.79,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.69,0:07:01.95,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Production Attribute. \NPrime Right of Resurrection!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.30,0:07:07.20,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,{\i1}You'll be back in our arms at last, Teppei.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.24,0:07:21.92,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,Huh? Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:23.40,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.88,0:07:26.13,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,Is that voice... Haruto?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.55,0:07:28.80,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,We've missed you, Teppei.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.31,0:07:31.91,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,Is that Big Sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.53,0:07:34.75,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,Is it really you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.20,0:07:39.23,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,How? And where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.57,0:07:41.09,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,We're in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.52,0:07:44.04,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Iruga helped us find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.04,0:07:46.74,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,Ren did?! Is he here right now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.74,0:07:51.49,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,No, he's not. Let me explain everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.21,0:07:55.20,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,An organization called the\N"Rights Specimen Laboratory Camp"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.20,0:07:58.87,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,announced a large-scale terrorist attack \Nand it's caused a panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.87,0:08:00.13,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,The Camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.59,0:08:02.79,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}So that's what's going on...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.23,0:08:06.56,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,The area you were in was exposed to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:09.80,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Iruga sensed you were both in danger \Nand escaped with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:14.28,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,He was a frequent visitor \Nat my friend's church.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.28,0:08:16.46,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,We were very lucky to have met.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.02,0:08:20.83,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,A large-scale terrorist attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.83,0:08:23.73,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,I don't remember any news like that \Non the radio before I fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.09,0:08:26.45,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,You were asleep for three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.45,0:08:27.77,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,Three days?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.50,0:08:33.41,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Iruga told us everything about the Camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.41,0:08:36.45,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,We're working together right now \Nto save the subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.96,0:08:41.71,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Teppei, give me your Obedience Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.71,0:08:43.59,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,What? The Obedience Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.88,0:08:45.90,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,The terrorist attack was just a diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.90,0:08:47.80,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,There's been incidents of researchers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:51.59,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,stealing Rights from subjects \Nwhile they're asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.31,0:08:55.19,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,You're in danger with the \NObedience Right in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.19,0:08:57.57,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,We're all safer with it in \Nan outsider's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.57,0:09:00.18,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Which is why I want you to give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.55,0:09:06.14,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,Sis, so Ren's out there \Nsaving people right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.14,0:09:07.09,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.58,0:09:09.12,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.12,0:09:11.24,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,He's finally come around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.18,0:09:13.91,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,I understand, then let me—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:16.86,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Hey, mind if I introduce myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.86,0:09:19.25,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,Wait, there's someone else here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.55,0:09:21.71,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,It's my best friend, Big Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.11,0:09:24.81,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, I'm Raion Ouno.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.81,0:09:28.20,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,I see Haruto is in good hands. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.17,0:09:33.19,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Sorry, I didn't mean to ruin the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.19,0:09:35.52,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I just couldn't handle being out of the loop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.18,0:09:37.85,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Makes sense, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.27,0:09:41.56,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hopefully that bought us a bit more time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.31,0:09:45.91,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Is this how Ryuta found us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.91,0:09:48.40,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,If Gobo's message is true...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:51.45,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,The same Emperor that Ryuta \Ncouldn't find back then
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.45,0:09:53.95,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,must be who I'm looking at right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.14,0:09:56.78,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Remember what you said at the park?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:09:57.54,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.54,0:09:59.66,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,You taught me how to take a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.93,0:10:04.67,Flashback,Saaya,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's all about focusing on or \Nframing around the main shot.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.99,0:10:07.89,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I finally get what you meant by that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.60,0:10:13.56,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,It's too early for friendly chit-chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.56,0:10:16.55,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,We're not out of the woods until \Nwe transfer the Obedience Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.94,0:10:19.77,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,You're right, Sis. Let's do that first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.89,0:10:20.85,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.32,0:10:22.85,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I declare parenthood!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.24,0:10:24.88,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,I order the Obedience Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.88,0:10:26.61,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,to transfer itself to my big sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.94,0:10:31.47,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's done! Our suffering has been rewarded!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.47,0:10:38.74,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,That should have transferred \Nthe Obedience Right to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.74,0:10:40.82,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Thank you, Teppei.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.82,0:10:43.66,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Now we can crush the Camp's plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.66,0:10:47.56,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Sis, why don't you try \Nusing it just to be safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.13,0:10:49.54,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.54,0:10:53.57,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,I'll cure your eyesight \Nwith the Obedience Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.57,0:10:54.59,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.59,0:10:58.10,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,I guess it's better to be safe. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.42,0:11:01.74,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,I order Teppei's eyes to be cured!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:04.70,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,So? Did it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:06.06,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Can you see me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.22,0:11:10.94,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,No, I can't. I'm still blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.73,0:11:12.72,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,It failed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.72,0:11:14.08,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,B-But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.75,0:11:16.60,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Checkmate!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.60,0:11:19.02,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}All right, Saneatsu Narita.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.02,0:11:20.77,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}All of our hope has led to this moment.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.77,0:11:22.20,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Put an end to this!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.05,0:11:25.84,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I exercise my Parental Authority \Nagainst Teppei Yoshii.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.21,0:11:28.43,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I'll now exercise the \NObedience Right on his behalf!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:30.21,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I order—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:30.94,Show Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(492,245)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.76,0:11:36.34,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Mornin', Saneatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.34,0:11:40.31,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,What's up? You're always \Nso energetic, Kazuhiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.31,0:11:43.27,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Man, you must really hate informatics!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.27,0:11:48.10,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Informatics? You mean computer \Nclass. I'm just so bad at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.10,0:11:50.47,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,When it comes to computers, \Nyou're "Sorry-atsu"!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.47,0:11:51.27,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Shaddup!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.86,0:11:53.76,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Is Ryuta here yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.76,0:11:55.12,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,He's prolly late again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.12,0:11:57.26,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Enough talking, guys. Turn your PCs on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.26,0:11:58.70,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.12,0:12:03.54,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Mornin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.54,0:12:05.12,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,You're late, Ryuta!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.55,0:12:09.21,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Not that you're missing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.95,0:12:13.38,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,All right then. Sensei, we gotta leave early!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.38,0:12:16.54,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,All right. Then today's class \Nwill be study hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.54,0:12:17.88,Default,Class,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.84,0:12:23.81,Default-Top,Omi,0,0,0,,Mm-help!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.84,0:12:23.93,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,It's not good to skip school!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.93,0:12:26.77,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,You're skipping too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.77,0:12:28.85,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,You two, quiet down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.85,0:12:30.10,Default,Kazuhiko/Omi,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.10,0:12:32.99,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,I-I wasn't using my \NCompliance Right that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.99,0:12:34.75,Default-Top,Saaya,0,0,0,,I know, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.79,0:12:37.81,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,In the end, I used my Parental Authority \Nto use the Obedience Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.81,0:12:40.21,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,And I turned back time to today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.65,0:12:43.37,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I've heard that the Obedience Right \Nis the strongest Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.37,0:12:46.75,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,But why turn back time to today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.36,0:12:49.44,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I still have a prosthetic right eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:51.44,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,not to mention the Visualization Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.44,0:12:55.71,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Why not wipe away the Camp's entire existence?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.71,0:13:00.44,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,The command needed to be short and concise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.00,0:13:04.09,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Retain the memories \Nof everyone involved with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.09,0:13:10.48,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,1)\fs24}Retain the memories of everyone involved with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.09,0:13:07.01,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Rights shall stay with their owners \Nas of June 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.22,0:13:10.48,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,1)\fs24\pos(320,119)}Rights shall stay with their owners as of June 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.01,0:13:10.48,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,And turn back time to June 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.10,0:13:10.48,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,1)\fs24\pos(320,215)}And turn back time to June 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.85,0:13:16.90,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,If the Camp never existed, \NI wouldn't have met ya guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.43,0:13:19.83,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,The test run didn't occur.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.53,0:13:23.20,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Our plan is about 80% complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:25.53,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Now we just have two more things to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.63,0:13:28.98,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Okay, let's pick up the pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.00,0:13:37.98,Default,Employee A,0,0,0,,You know, I don't think \Nthis place needs guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:41.27,Default,Employee B,0,0,0,,Probably not. I can't think of \Nanyone who'd come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:42.22,Default,Employee B,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.68,0:13:46.20,Default,Employee A,0,0,0,,Stop! Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.20,0:13:47.44,Default,Employee B,0,0,0,,How did you get here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.47,0:13:49.77,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,With that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.48,0:13:57.69,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,Prime Right of Immobilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.69,0:14:00.15,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Perfect. You're up next!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.55,0:14:01.90,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Touya Mutsuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.49,0:14:09.29,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,Multiply gravity by 100 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.07,0:14:15.40,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Who would've thought \Nyou'd be so willing to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.40,0:14:17.47,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I gotta thank you, Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.92,0:14:21.92,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Returning to this day \Nhelped me come to my senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.35,0:14:25.51,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Although, I'm still upset you tricked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.27,0:14:29.65,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,But I understand where you're coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.65,0:14:32.56,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,I'm in full agreement. Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.56,0:14:36.32,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,We'll resurrect you later, so go all out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.32,0:14:36.83,Default,Hirayama & Mitsuki,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.83,0:14:41.05,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Are you sure we can trust him, Kisaragi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.05,0:14:44.16,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,My lies were always for my own sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.57,0:14:47.78,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,However, I can't help but feel as though
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.78,0:14:50.58,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Raion lies from a place \Nof goodwill and kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.24,0:14:53.74,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,So, I'd like to trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:14:58.37,Default,Employee C,0,0,0,,It's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:00.00,Default,Employee D,0,0,0,,They're using Rights!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.00,0:15:02.08,Default,Employee D,0,0,0,,Must be a revenge attack by escapees!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.08,0:15:03.72,Default,Employee D,0,0,0,,Hurry and inform the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.42,0:15:06.38,Default,Employee E,0,0,0,,Huh?! I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:08.96,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I stopped you with space division!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.96,0:15:10.89,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Then I'll point them the right way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.42,0:15:12.35,Default,Employee E,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.87,0:15:15.35,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Mind if you lead the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.35,0:15:16.27,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Sudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.97,0:15:17.98,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.90,0:15:21.69,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,It's the Camp's transceiver. Take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.72,0:15:24.34,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,I'll mass-produce it using my Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.34,0:15:26.88,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Yagihashi, spread them across \Nthe Camp with your Induction Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:29.76,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,So Raion and the others can use them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.99,0:15:34.54,Default,Employee F,0,0,0,,Large-scale damages seen \Nacross the entire facility!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.54,0:15:35.94,Default,Employee F,0,0,0,,Cause unknown!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.94,0:15:38.30,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Impossible. How could it suddenly...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.30,0:15:40.25,Default,Employee G,0,0,0,,Director Kirishima! State of emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.65,0:15:43.68,Default,Employee G,0,0,0,,We're under attack \Nby a group of Rights owners!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.98,0:15:48.64,Default,Employee G,0,0,0,,They've mastered the Rights \Nfar beyond our level!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.64,0:15:51.64,Default,Employee G,0,0,0,,They're trampling all through our facility!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.64,0:15:52.98,Default,Employee G,0,0,0,,We can't stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.98,0:15:55.81,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Th-There's no way! Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.96,0:15:58.98,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,There we go! For real!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.98,0:16:01.94,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,All right then, let's finish this up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.44,0:16:04.60,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I've sent the map to you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.40,0:16:10.18,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Attack the Camp... Is that \Nthe first of our remaining tasks?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.18,0:16:12.34,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,No, we're just warming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.34,0:16:14.51,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,We really did a number on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.51,0:16:16.20,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,All clear here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.20,0:16:17.87,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,We'll lead the test subjects!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.87,0:16:18.67,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Mm-what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.11,0:16:20.75,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,It's the facility map!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.75,0:16:25.02,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Someone must have found it \Nand sent it to Gobo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.99,0:16:28.01,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Perfect, we've done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.01,0:16:29.61,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Let's move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.22,0:16:31.55,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz13\fs40\bord1\shad2\fax-0.2\pos(403,13)\c&H727F65&\3c&H414A3C&\4c&H414A3C&\4a&H2B&}Control Room
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:32.49,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Bring out our best experiment!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.49,0:16:33.76,Default,Director,0,0,0,,He'll take care of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:35.99,Default,Director,0,0,0,,In the VIP Room on the fifth floor. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.99,0:16:37.24,Default,Employee F,0,0,0,,Ye-Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.25,0:16:40.69,Italics,Iruga,0,0,0,,You heard him. See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.05,0:16:44.52,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Pretty much as I figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.89,0:16:46.19,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Ready, Knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.19,0:16:47.33,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Sure am!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.33,0:16:48.65,Default,Lili,0,0,0,,Go big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.97,0:16:50.49,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Destruction Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.08,0:17:01.58,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,As promised, I'm here to save you, Haruto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.96,0:17:04.57,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Yeah. I knew you'd come, Raion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.64,0:17:09.93,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,There was no test run, \Nwhich meant no Tasuketsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.93,0:17:12.32,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,It was all so you wouldn't become the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.87,0:17:15.68,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,For us to free you from \Nthe shackles of the Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:17.35,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,this was our only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.04,0:17:21.71,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,But still, that meant \NI had to lie to you... a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.71,0:17:23.14,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Haruto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.30,0:17:26.34,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Like you said, Raion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.40,0:17:29.26,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,No matter how much I betrayed people,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.26,0:17:31.86,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,you'd believe in the real me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.34,0:17:34.95,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Same goes for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.22,0:17:39.70,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,No matter how much you lie, \NI believe in the real you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.50,0:17:41.71,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.37,0:17:44.04,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Big Bro! Big Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.28,0:17:51.08,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,That's how reunions ought to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.30,0:17:57.05,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Let's get the most important \Npart out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.05,0:17:58.80,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Are you Kou Kirishima?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.80,0:18:02.09,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,I am. Are you Saneatsu Narita?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.09,0:18:04.02,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I assume you understand the plan by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.56,0:18:05.90,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.32,0:18:08.61,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,This will end things once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.57,0:18:16.84,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,From fighting to protect others, \Nto fighting to save others.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.49,0:18:21.25,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to you. \NThank you, Raion Ouno.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.25,0:18:23.76,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,The only person I saved is Haruto.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.76,0:18:27.36,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You're the one who saved \Nthe world, Saneatsu Narita.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.93,0:18:30.42,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Now for the last step!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:36.43,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Once again, I declare parenthood \Nto Teppei Yoshii.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.51,0:18:42.33,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I order all victims related \Nto this Camp be resurrected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.68,0:18:42.56,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,1)\fs24}I order all victims related to this Camp be resurrected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.33,0:18:45.68,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,All sacrifices given in turn \Nfor Rights shall be reversed,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.56,0:18:49.65,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,1)\fs24\pos(320,10)}I order for victims related to this Camp be resurrected.\NAll sacrifices given in turn for Rights shall be reversed,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.68,0:18:49.65,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,unless otherwise intended by the owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.94,0:18:49.65,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,1)\fs24\pos(496,266)}unless otherwise intended\Nby the owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.98,0:18:53.52,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,The Mother Light shall lose its powers \Nand shatter into pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.52,0:18:58.93,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,And finally, all Rights shall be returned \Nto the world of consciousness!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.19,0:19:05.72,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.59,0:19:08.68,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.13,0:19:10.27,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Wha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.04,0:19:16.09,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Haruto, what's up with your eyes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.01,0:19:18.76,Show Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(536,54)\shad0\3c&HF6D9FA&\3a&H00&}Lame!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.09,0:19:18.76,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Don't laugh! These are \Nmy natural eyes, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.89,0:19:20.01,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,Phew.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.48,0:19:24.13,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,Sis, Haruto, I heard about everything you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.77,0:19:27.94,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,Brace yourselves for a long \Nlecture about all this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.37,0:19:29.69,Default,Kisaragi/Emperor,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.69,0:19:35.20,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Take it easy on them. After all, \Nthe past has been totally erased!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.32,0:19:38.57,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Teppei-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.93,0:19:41.08,Default,Teppei,0,0,0,,I'm home, Ren.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.14,0:19:44.91,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Oh, looks like the victims are back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.81,0:19:47.98,Default,Omi's father,0,0,0,,Omi? Is that Omi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.64,0:19:54.12,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Dad! Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.12,0:19:57.22,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Erased or not, the ones who know \Nwill remember what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.62,0:20:00.93,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Narita, you sure made the right call.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.78,0:20:05.85,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Now, let's go back. To our normal lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.38,0:20:10.25,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,And the future that \Nwas waiting for us all along!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.83,0:20:17.86,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not long after, the Camp's \NDirector Junichi Kirishima was{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.86,0:20:20.72,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}arrested as the main culprit \Nof a large-scale kidnapping.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.72,0:20:23.99,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}He and the rest of the researchers \Nwere sent to prison.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.65,0:20:28.01,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}And so, without even a trace of the Rights,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.01,0:20:29.50,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}the world returned back to normal.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.66,0:20:36.01,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Still, as long as we're connected,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.01,0:20:38.38,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}it'll remain a fragment of the truth,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.75,0:20:42.26,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}leaving behind a few mysteries \Nhidden in our memories.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.54,0:20:51.48,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,'Sup!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.79,0:20:54.25,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Heading home alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.25,0:20:56.05,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Let's hit the arcade!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.05,0:20:58.03,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Don't get me mixed up in this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.03,0:20:59.44,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Now's our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.24,0:21:05.51,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}As long as we're connected,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.51,0:21:08.06,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}it'll remain a fragment of the truth.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.06,0:21:10.11,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which might not be all that bad.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.96,0:21:19.97,Next Ep Title,Sign,0,0,0,,Towards the Light
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.65,0:21:19.44,Default-Top,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not bad at all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.14,0:22:49.18,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1)\an2\bord2\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H26&}Thank you!
